Coverage: Graph

Purpose:
  Defines coverage tracking for tasks across multiple dimensions.

CoverageDimensions:
  Functional:
    BDD
    Unit
    Integration
    E2E
  Security:
    Authentication
    Authorization
    Input Validation
    Idempotency
    Rate Limit
    Abuse Test
    Pentest
  Infrastructure:
    Docker
    CI/CD
    Monitoring
    Backup
    Load Test
    DDoS Strategy

CoverageMap:
  TASK-<ID>:
    BDD: ✅
    Unit: ✅
    Integration: ✅
    E2E: ❌
    Security: ✅
    Load: ❌

  SEC-<ID>:
    Authentication: ✅
    Authorization: ✅
    Input Validation: ✅
    Rate Limit: ❌
    Abuse Test: ❌
    Pentest: ❌

CoverageRules:
  [CV1]  Every task MUST have functional coverage.
  [CV2]  Security coverage MUST be tracked per task.
  [CV3]  Infrastructure coverage MUST be tracked per task.
  [CV4]  Missing coverage MUST be flagged as risk.
  [CV5]  Coverage MUST be visible in graph.

State: +
  